        "original_id": "5a0df7b7-8550-5f38-aabb-d6914c78e90b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Green on Red, Hollywood Undead\n- Songs and Albums: “Coming Back Down”, Gravity Talks, American Tragedy\n- People: Dan Stuart, Chris Cacavas, Alex MacNicol, Jack Waterson\n- Places: Tucson, Arizona; Los Angeles, California\n- Topics: Paisley Underground, punk scene\n\nFacts:\n- Green on Red was an American rock band formed in the Tucson, Arizona punk scene.\n- Green on Red was based for most of its career in Los Angeles, California.\n- Green on Red was loosely associated with the Paisley Underground.\n- Hollywood Undead is an American rap rock band from Los Angeles, California, formed in 2005.\n- Gravity Talks includes songs written by Dan Stuart, Chris Cacavas, Alex MacNicol, and Jack Waterson.\n- “Coming Back Down” is a song by Hollywood Undead.\n- “Coming Back Down” is the tenth track on Hollywood Undead’s album American Tragedy.\n- “Coming Back Down” was the third single from Hollywood Undead’s second full-length album American Tragedy.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
